From 0668fd4e19d1bcaca2c37ab356a2c473ff2cb83e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Oussama Benjelloun <benje.oussama@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 4 Sep 2026 14:25:02 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] HIP: add DeviceAPI::HIP and hip/hip_gfx* target features

Adds the Target/DeviceAPI plumbing for a native AMD GPU backend:
features hip, hip_gfx90a, hip_gfx942, hip_gfx950, hip_gfx1030, hip_gfx1100,
hip_gfx1151, hip_gfx1201 (HL_HIP_ARCH env override; JIT autodetect via
halide_hip_compute_capability), DeviceAPI::HIP, JIT runtime kinds, runtime
API exports, serialization enum, Python enums, and the user_context list
entries for halide_hip_run / halide_hip_initialize_kernels.

Co-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
